433	// Every value that reaches the node shell is validated here (isValidUnixUsername
434	// / isValidHostingDomain / isValidSubdomainLabel / cron validators) AND re-checked
435	// in the worker. Caps are enforced inside a Serializable transaction so concurrent
436	// creates cannot both read a stale count and blow past the plan (same discipline
437	// as createHostingDatabase). The task is queued in the SAME tx as the row create.
